#: templates/admin-backup.php
msgid "Automatically export every Kanso board to a versioned JSON file on a daily schedule, keeping the last few backups per board. Point this at a Nextcloud folder; mount that folder as an S3 External Storage to keep off-site copies. Kanso writes the files via Nextcloud and never holds S3 credentials."
msgstr "按每日计划自动把每个 Kanso 看板导出为带版本的 JSON 文件，每个看板保留最近几份备份。请指向一个 Nextcloud 文件夹；把该文件夹挂载为 S3 外部存储即可保存异地副本。Kanso 通过 Nextcloud 写入文件，从不持有 S3 凭据。"

